{"body":{"kept":"Whole in the author's words: all seven of the author's utterances, and after each the essence of the session's answer in its own voice, the fuller answers written in the conversation and not kept. Whether each came spoken or typed is the session's reading; one word the dictation misheard is corrected, with what it wrote kept on the word. The work is in its commit: the kernel drawn from a prototype into the engine and the interface's sets worked out by it; the language said as text and written in code by a template; glass's functions named each by one word, with their ids kept, and some written in the language in the field; src/tools/ask.ts, a local engine at the command line, the probe and the read tool retired for it; the wiki brought to it. Each piece was read by fresh agents, a design attacked before it was built, the code read for its tone and bugs, and the command line used cold by an agent knowing nothing else, and what they found was mended; 169 tests pass.","on":"2026-11-10","paths":[{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13W"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13X"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13Y"}],"said":[{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC06Q"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC09J"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0BJ"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0E5"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0F1"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0H7"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0M8"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0Q8"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0QQ"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0S7"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0V6"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0ZZ"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC11D"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13V"},{"$ref":"1M7374KJ1SA700A"},{"$ref":"1M7374KQGN9N03Q"},{"$ref":"1M7374KXEEM500S"},{"$ref":"1M7374M374CS030"},{"$ref":"1M7374M94F5T005"},{"$ref":"1M7374MENR1B06B"},{"$ref":"1M737M3CFCDJ020"}],"voice":{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC001"}},"id":"1M7360TVPDXC000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000000"],"name":"An eighth session, kept whole: one language for expressions, the kernel drawn into the engine, and the field read at the command line","prev":"89d108ff4286ccc4599b2e936db958a5ec667efd15d0b5c6e4bdc3b0036e20a1"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC11D"},{"$ref":"1M7374MENR1B06B"},{"$ref":"1M737M3CFCDJ020"}],"opens":"In order, each step grounding the next. The address and the search were said in the one language within this session, and the reader says where one is by the route function. So first now, patterns: each store's integration answering a pattern's clauses, glass's from an index of arrays, grounded by what ask and the search are actually asked; expressions stay calls. Then glass's store ships its index, and the lexicon becomes a function. Postponed until it is discussed how the store is split into packages, as a module ships its store: the main store's types held twice, word, lexeme, lexicon, paragraph and sentence, the paper's set born apart for its two-column page; the author's lean is that such primitives come from one source package that anything holding prose depends on, so the paper's words would be the same word as everything else; and a commit that gives a whole two parts of one name refused. Beside them, as wanted: the statistics and functions the main store declared in an older form said again in the language; the strings nested in records measured. Pinned: time and at, streams, programs. The next session begins at patterns, its bootstrap read through ask.","restsOn":["The plan from here","A store answers patterns","An expression drawn as itself"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7360TVPDXC13W","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The plan from here","prev":"89d108ff4286ccc4599b2e936db958a5ec667efd15d0b5c6e4bdc3b0036e20a1"}
